{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"高井俐香です🎠"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"”ホワイトアウト“"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"という単語は雨や風によって周囲が真っ白になり周りがまったく見えなくなる現象です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあそこまでは行かなかったのですが、昨日はそれくらい視界が悪かったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雨の中のお散歩は中々厳しいな〜と思っていましたが、霧雨で助かりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずいぶん久しぶりの雨だったような気がします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は先月の大雨の反動からか毎日晴れてましたからね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakamichi-biyori.pages.dev/blog/public/media/v3_cdd29c1d359c57456938fe6b/0.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"𓆉𓂃◌𓈒𓐍◌𓈒 𓆟𓂃◌𓈒𓐍"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"近況報告〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"念願のアイカツアンコールで遊ぶことができました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1時間くらい待ったよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度はにこさんといくんだー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"下田とパンケーキを食べに行きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのあとウィンドウショッピングもしたんだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度そのお写真もあげるね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakamichi-biyori.pages.dev/blog/public/media/v3_cdd29c1d359c57456938fe6b/1.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日さきちゃんともんじゃにいきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"念願の。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分で焼くのは初めて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美味しかったよ。また行こうね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マクドの一部メニューががなくなるということで、りかたんのおすすめバーガーを教えておきますね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アブリダブルです。アブリダブルが一番美味しいです。異論は認めます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakamichi-biyori.pages.dev/blog/public/media/v3_cdd29c1d359c57456938fe6b/2.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakamichi-biyori.pages.dev/blog/public/media/v3_cdd29c1d359c57456938fe6b/3.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakamichi-biyori.pages.dev/blog/public/media/v3_cdd29c1d359c57456938fe6b/4.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakamichi-biyori.pages.dev/blog/public/media/v3_cdd29c1d359c57456938fe6b/5.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"🎧Anarchy/Official髭男dismさん"}]}